; Accepted deviation: two pads of one account on one day, in two files. Beancount
; orders the directives of a day by their line, whatever their file, so the pad on
; the later line of its file wins (Equity:X, line 9 of x.bean, after line 1 of
; y.bean). Zhang orders them by file, in the order the ledger includes them, so the
; pad of the file included last wins (Equity:Y). The other pad is unused.
option "operating_currency" "CNY"

1970-01-01 commodity CNY
1970-01-01 open Assets:A
1970-01-01 open Equity:X
1970-01-01 open Equity:Y

include "same_day_pads_in_two_files/x.bean"
include "same_day_pads_in_two_files/y.bean"

2024-01-05 balance Assets:A  100 CNY
